sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant B as BlackboardService
    participant P as Provider control adapter
    participant A as Addressed AI tab
    U->>B: Add question with quote and target
    B->>B: Commit reaction + thread + inbox event
    B-->>U: Saved and recipient queued
    B->>P: Deliver event at supported boundary
    P-->>B: Native accepted or unavailable/unknown
    P->>A: Read assigned board and event
    A->>B: Claim event with generation
    A->>B: Read target, WIP and source context
    A->>B: Commit thread answer + event receipt
    B-->>U: Answer at the original target
    U->>B: Resolve question when satisfied
